{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/b3714e6f591ef2de8a7717ab3c4e906f.poster.avif?t=1759926447\" width=616 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/b3714e6f591ef2de8a7717ab3c4e906f.webm?t=1759926447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/b3714e6f591ef2de8a7717ab3c4e906f.mp4?t=1759926447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEKTORI</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sektori is an intense, fast paced twin-stick shooter infused with hard hitting techno music. Choose your upgrades carefully and create powerful builds to take on the relentless enemies and epic bosses on a constantly evolving battlefield. Sektori is a game that requires your complete focus, a game where the high-adrenaline visuals, music, and gameplay come together to transport you into another state of consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, pure gameplay. Quick runs. Lots of challenge and replayability.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A five world campaign mode with dynamically changing levels and tons of enemy variation - including epic evolving bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternate ships and configurable upgrade decks to mold your run with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three difficulty modes suited for all players, including a &quot;Revolution&quot; campaign mode for maximal challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six alternate game modes, like Classic, Gates and Assault</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied selection of challenges and medals to reach for</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEVELOPER NOTES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Sektori I wanted to create a shoot'em up where every run feels familiar, but is still completely unique. A game of skill, not memorization. The hand crafted attack waves, levels and even the bosses are combined, randomized and layered with the upgrade systems in a way that creates an interesting challenge for every run. The aesthetics of the game are very much inspired by techno music. Fast, detailed, colorful, saturated, intense, aggressive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive in, take on the challenge as it comes and have fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WARNING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains flashing lights that may make it unsuitable for people with photosensitive epilepsy or other photosensitive conditions. Player discretion is advised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/836328238796585f0af19b30658036b8.poster.avif?t=1759926447\" width=616 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/836328238796585f0af19b30658036b8.webm?t=1759926447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/extras/836328238796585f0af19b30658036b8.mp4?t=1759926447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2105620?t=1759926447","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759926447","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/44dd4ae67d73015091b88ecfacc2fa734800e48a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759926447","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105620/44dd4ae67d73015091b88ecfacc2fa734800e48a/capsule_184x69